- TopBar title is "مسابقات" (was "مچ‌دی"); subtitle appends the single
  "ساعت‌ها به وقت تهران" mention and the per-row Tehran caption is gone.
- Rows: status lives in the time column (kickoff clock / live minute in
  coral / نیمه‌وقت / پایان muted), the chevron is removed, and scores are
  a bold two-line column at the row end aligned per team.
- Filter chips under the day strip: همه / زنده (live count, hidden at 0) /
  تیم‌های من (hidden with no picks); a stale chip selection falls back to
  همه instead of an empty feed.
- Inline ad: dark rounded slot, max-height 60px with overflow clipped,
  small localized "تبلیغ" label; creative can no longer render as a bare
  white block floating over the feed.

